  </p>
  
  <h2>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">Synthetic Assets in Decentralized Finance</span>
  </h2>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">Synthetic assets play an important role, especially in the area of Decentralized Finance or DeFi. The use of synthetic USD has been of particular popularity. Today’s investors are more concerned with obtaining the best possible return on their assets than with anything else. Synthetic assets are here to save the day by enabling smoother and cheaper transactions in such a situation rather than filling out loads of paperwork and hefty contracts required of normal assets. </span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <img decoding="async" srcset="https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/2-300x150.png 300w, https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/2.png 512w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" loading="lazy" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-465304" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/2.png" alt="" width="512" height="256" />
